1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,750
Outlook sempat mati sekitar sehari.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:05,462
Dan itu bukan karena diretas.

3
00:00:05,862 --> 00:00:07,231
Tanggal 12 November,

4
00:00:07,231 --> 00:00:09,559
server email Microsoft mulai gagal

5
00:00:09,559 --> 00:00:11,955
di pemeriksaan otomatisnya sendiri,

6
00:00:11,955 --> 00:00:12,845
lalu offline.

7
00:00:13,025 --> 00:00:16,623
Server yang tersisa kewalahan dan ikut tumbang.

8
00:00:16,803 --> 00:00:19,940
Outlook dan Teams lumpuh di seluruh dunia.

9
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:23,012
Penyebab pastinya belum diumumkan Microsoft.

10
00:00:23,412 --> 00:00:24,823
Kalau terjadi lagi,

11
00:00:24,823 --> 00:00:27,348
cek dulu halaman status Microsoft.

12
00:00:27,528 --> 00:00:29,507
Siap-siap email telat masuk.

13
00:00:29,687 --> 00:00:30,627
Yang mendesak,

14
00:00:30,627 --> 00:00:32,976
pindahkan ke telepon atau WhatsApp.

15
00:00:33,376 --> 00:00:34,823
Perlu pindah ke Google?

16
00:00:35,003 --> 00:00:35,398
Bisa,

17
00:00:35,398 --> 00:00:37,690
tapi Google juga pernah down,

18
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:40,377
dan migrasi satu kantor itu mahal.

19
00:00:40,557 --> 00:00:42,774
Rencana cadangan jauh lebih murah.

20
00:00:43,174 --> 00:00:45,818
Kita nggak bisa mencegah Microsoft gangguan,

21
00:00:45,818 --> 00:00:48,042
tapi bisa menjaga bisnis tetap jalan.

22
00:00:48,222 --> 00:00:50,425
Tentukan jalur komunikasi kedua,

23
00:00:50,425 --> 00:00:52,972
simpan kontak penting secara offline,

24
00:00:52,972 --> 00:00:54,900
dan latih rencananya sekali.

25
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:58,093
Kantor kamu ngapain waktu Outlook mati?

26
00:00:58,093 --> 00:00:59,382
Tulis di komentar.
